{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>增美神長效維他命C1000毫克100粒裝（Jamieson Timed Release Vitamin C 1000 mg）邊度買平？新假期整理屈臣氏、萬寧、莎莎、HKTVmall、Market Place及龍豐共6間零售商的網店報價。以同款單瓶標價計，最低與次低相差HK$59，約30%。</p>\n<h2>增美神長效維他命C1000毫克100粒裝各網店報價</h2>\n<table>\n<thead></thead>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>零售商</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單瓶標價</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單瓶總額</strong></th>\n<th><strong>計價條件</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>最低已核實｜莎莎</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$139</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$139</strong></td>\n<td><strong>單瓶標價，網店限定及平行進口</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>龍豐</td>\n<td>HK$198</td>\n<td>HK$198</td>\n<td>單瓶標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HKTVmall</td>\n<td>HK$242</td>\n<td>HK$242</td>\n<td>單瓶標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Market Place</td>\n<td>HK$242</td>\n<td>HK$242</td>\n<td>單瓶標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>屈臣氏</td>\n<td>HK$242</td>\n<td>HK$242</td>\n<td>單瓶標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>萬寧</td>\n<td>HK$242</td>\n<td>HK$242</td>\n<td>單瓶標價</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>增美神長效維他命C1000毫克100粒裝單瓶價錢點計？</h2>\n<p>買一瓶，莎莎的同款網上標價為HK$139，較表列次低標價HK$198少HK$59。莎莎標示為網店限定及平行進口，本次用網店標價比較。</p>\n<p>以上為2026年11月11日商戶網上報價，未計運費，價格、優惠及供應以商戶為準。網店來源：<a href=\"https://www.watsons.com.hk/zh-hk/%E5%A2%9E%E7%BE%8E%E7%A5%9E-%E5%A2%9E%E7%BE%8E%E7%A5%9E-%E9%95%B7%E6%95%88%E7%B6%AD%E4%BB%96%E5%91%BDc1000%E6%AF%AB%E5%85%8B-100%E7%B2%92/p/BP_297042\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">屈臣氏</a><a href=\"https://www.mannings.com.hk/zh-hant/jamieson-timed-release-vitamin-c-1000mg-100pcs/p/096651\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">萬寧</a><a href=\"https://www.sasa.com.hk/SalePage/Index/303253\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">莎莎</a><a href=\"https://www.hktvmall.com/hktv/zh/main/Jamieson-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%97%97%E8%89%A6%E5%BA%97/s/H6754005/%E8%AD%B7%E7%90%86%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5/%E8%AD%B7%E7%90%86%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5/%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5%E7%94%A2%E5%93%81/%E7%B6%AD%E4%BB%96%E5%91%BD/%E9%95%B7%E6%95%88%E7%B6%AD%E4%BB%96%E5%91%BDC1000%E6%AF%AB%E5%85%8B-100%E7%B2%92/p/H6754005_S_H3281322125\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">HKTVmall</a><a href=\"https://www.marketplacehk.com/zh-hant/wellcome/p/%E5%A2%9E%E7%BE%8E%E7%A5%9E-%E7%B6%AD%E4%BB%96%E5%91%BDC%20TR%201000%20100s/i/116575586.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Market Place</a><a href=\"https://eshop.lungfung.hk/product/mdn190328/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">龍豐</a></p>\n<p>維他命C是水溶性營養素，參與人體製造膠原蛋白，也有助吸收來自植物性食物的鐵。如對成分或服用有疑問，建議先諮詢醫生或其他合資格的醫護專業人士。<a href=\"https://ods.od.nih.gov/factsheets/VitaminC-Consumer/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">美國國立衞生研究院維他命C資料</a></p>\n<p>計算方法：（較高標價－較低標價）÷較高標價×100%。本次以（HK$198－HK$139）÷HK$198×100%計，約30%。上述比例未計運費及額外活動，亦不代表全港最低價、歷史低價或不同包裝版本的配方已完全核實一致。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17943335862269317_11170420006af35b931d5af.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"增美神長效維他命C1000毫克100粒裝格價：莎莎 HK$139；單瓶按同數量基準比較約平30%\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17943335862269317_11170420006af35b931d5af.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a></p>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>點樣先可以用圖中價格買到增美神長效維他命C1000毫克100粒裝？<i></i></p>\n<p>以2026年11月11日網上報價，莎莎的單瓶商品總額為HK$139。條件為單瓶標價，網店限定及平行進口，未計運費。</p>\n<p>今次格價比較哪一款包裝？<i></i></p>\n<p>比較每粒1000毫克、100粒長效配方。莎莎標為網店限定及平行進口，選購時可核對包裝及商戶條款。</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T18:25:14.638772+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":883,"images":1,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T17:59:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T22:41:56.970650+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T18:18:43.760181+00:00","content_hash":"96a46f3230c8430c866322e4f790b3325f70dc4e5f57fa065ff89e31c783c9f7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}